Artemis is managed by chezmoi. The checkout is `{{ joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir .path.workspace.example "artemis" }}`. The CLI on `PATH` is `artemis`. The MCP server is already configured as `artemis`; do not run `artemis mcp --install`, which rewrites IDE configs chezmoi owns. Secrets and traces live in `{{ joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir .path.data.artemis }}`, not in the checkout.
{{- $rules := joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir .path.workspace.example "artemis/mcp_server/rules.md" }}
{{- if glob $rules }}

{{ output "cat" $rules }}
{{- else }}

The testing mindset is `{{ $rules }}`. It appears after chezmoi clones the checkout. Until then, call `mobile_diagnose` when a tool fails, use `mobile_run_task` with profile `flash` for a short UI flow, and use `pro` when the task needs a plan, checkpoints, or logcat. Ask which device to use when more than one is connected.
{{- end }}
